OL,3,GNEWSATrump doubles down on united
OL,4,AIreland comments on day two of visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has doubled down
OL,7,Fon his support for a united Ireland.
OL,9,FHe spent day two of his visit at Trump
OL,10,FInternational Golf Links in Doonbeg,
OL,11,FCounty Clare, for the Irish Open.
OL,13,FOn Saturday, Trump told reporters he
OL,14,Fwould love to see a united Ireland
OL,15,Fwhile at a meeting with the Taoiseach
OL,16,F(Irish PM) Micheal Martin in Dublin.
OL,18,FSpeaking on Sunday at his Doonbeg golf
OL,19,Fresort, he said it would be natural to
OL,20,Fput Ireland and Northern Ireland
OL,21,F"together".
